WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.460
[MUSIC]

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:15.230
My name is Eduardo Lins Henrique, I'm
the co-founder of a company called Movile.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:18.440
Now I am the CEO of Wavy.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:24.229
My career before SEP was mostly
about being an entrepreneur,

00:00:24.229 --> 00:00:30.795
full of dreams, always thinking big,
but I was missing framework and

00:00:30.795 --> 00:00:36.824
knowledge and techniques to deal
with the growth of my company.

00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:38.889
[MUSIC]

00:00:38.889 --> 00:00:42.330
What we learn at SEP is,
how can i be much better?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:49.600
How can i disrupt my current business to
create something 10, 20, 50 times bigger?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.810
SEP brought to me not only the framework,
the books, the theories,

00:00:54.810 --> 00:01:00.740
but also the networking with colleagues,
also a networking of professors and

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:05.440
specialists in certain areas
that helps me a lot when I

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:10.920
have a challenge or I need to build
a new plan in your area, a new company.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:15.120
Sometimes being a CEO or
being an entrepreneur,

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:20.820
it's a very lonely experience.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:25.644
Having access to a group friends
that are in the same level

00:01:25.644 --> 00:01:30.566
that you are and
sometimes feel the same way that you feel,

00:01:30.566 --> 00:01:34.309
you can give a call,
you can ask for advice.

00:01:34.309 --> 00:01:39.812
[MUSIC]

00:01:39.812 --> 00:01:44.146
If you're thinking about coming to SEP,
it's important for

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:49.307
you to be ready to change, to change and
have a higher impact in your life,

00:01:49.307 --> 00:01:53.555
higher impact in your company,
higher impact in the world,

00:01:53.555 --> 00:01:57.008
because this is absolutely
transformational.

00:01:57.008 --> 00:02:02.972
[MUSIC]

